.vercel

# Client report data — real clients are NEVER committed/deployed.
# Only the Copper Pot demo (mock data) ships.
reports/data/*.json
!reports/data/TheCopperPot.json

# Encrypted client payloads ARE safe to deploy — AES-256-GCM, key derived from
# the passcode Mack texts the client. Plaintext <Client>.json stays ignored above.
!reports/data/*.enc.json
